# API client

Read [`docs/adr/0007-ci-and-client.md`](../../docs/adr/0007-ci-and-client.md).

- `packages/client/src/index.ts` is the committed TypeScript contract.
- After a public API change: update the client, bump its version, and tell
  `ElWarsha-web` to pin the new version.
- `yarn openapi:export` writes `openapi.json`. `yarn client:build` copies the
  client to `packages/client/dist`. Do not treat those outputs as source.
